 "summary": "This Data Processing Agreement, effective 1 May 2025, makes Copperline Software GmbH a processor of personal data for Northwind Labs, Inc. as controller. It lasts as long as an unspecified main services agreement, is governed by Delaware law, and requires breach notice within 48 hours."
